Source: autoware-data-1-9-0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Jerry Lin <jerry73204@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), aria2, ca-certificates
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: autoware-data-1-9-0
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         autoware-data-vision-1-9-0,
         autoware-data-perception3d-1-9-0,
         autoware-data-planning-1-9-0
Description: Autoware ML model data files (metapackage)
 This metapackage pulls in every Autoware ML model data package.
 .
 The models are split across several binary packages because the combined
 payload exceeds GitHub's 2 GiB release-asset limit. Install this package to
 get all of them.

Package: autoware-data-vision-1-9-0
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Autoware 2D camera and traffic light recognition models
 Camera-based 2D object detection and traffic light recognition models:
 RTMDet and YOLOX detectors, traffic light fine detector and classifier.

Package: autoware-data-perception3d-1-9-0
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Autoware 3D object detection and camera-LiDAR fusion models
 3D object detection, semantic segmentation and camera-LiDAR fusion models:
 StreamPETR, BEVDet, BEVFusion, TransFusion, PTv3, FRNet, Apollo instance
 segmentation and PointPainting.

Package: autoware-data-planning-1-9-0
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Autoware planning, prediction, localization and calibration models
 End-to-end driving and planning models plus supporting models: VAD,
 Diffusion Planner, SIMPL trajectory prediction, YabLoc pose initializer
 and the sensor calibration status classifier.
